==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|cerebellum}}, diminutive of {{m|la|cerebrum}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|en|/ˌseɹəˈbeləm/}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|s|cerebella}}

# {{lb|en|neuroanatomy}} Part of the [[hindbrain]] in [[vertebrate]]s. In [[human]]s it lies between the [[brainstem]] and the [[cerebrum]]. It plays an important role in sensory perception, motor output, balance and posture.

====Holonyms====
* {{l|en|hindbrain}}

